# Unit11
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit11核心词汇

crop/krɒp/庄稼；收成/The farmers had a good crop this year.
cross/krɒs/穿过；十字架/Be careful when you cross the street.
crowd/kraʊd/人群/A large crowd gathered in the square.
crucial/ˈkruːʃl/关键的；决定性的/This is a crucial decision for the company.
cruel/ˈkruːl/残酷的；残忍的/It's cruel to keep animals in cages.
crush/krʌʃ/压碎；压垮/The machine can crush rocks into powder.
cry/kraɪ/哭；喊叫/The baby cried all night.
culture/ˈkʌltʃər/文化/The two countries have very different cultures.
cup/kʌp/杯子/She poured tea into the cup.
cure/kjʊr/治愈；疗法/Scientists are searching for a cure for cancer.
curious/ˈkjʊriəs/好奇的/Children are naturally curious about the world.
current/ˈkɜːrənt/当前的；电流/The current situation is very complicated.
curriculum/kəˈrɪkjələm/课程体系/The school updated its curriculum this year.
custom/ˈkʌstəm/风俗；习惯/It is a local custom to celebrate the New Year.
customer/ˈkʌstəmər/顾客/The customer is always right.
cycle/ˈsaɪkl/循环；自行车/The seasons follow a natural cycle.
daily/ˈdeɪli/每日的/She reads the daily newspaper every morning.
damage/ˈdæmɪdʒ/损害；损失/The storm caused serious damage to the buildings.
damp/dæmp/潮湿的/The clothes are still damp from the rain.
dance/dæns/跳舞/She loves to dance to the music.
danger/ˈdeɪndʒər/危险/Smoking is a danger to health.
dare/der/敢于/She didn't dare to speak in public.
dark/dɑːrk/黑暗的/It gets dark very early in winter.
data/ˈdeɪtə/数据/We need more data to support the theory.
date/deɪt/日期；约会/What is the date of the meeting?
daughter/ˈdɔːtər/女儿/Their daughter is studying at university.
dawn/dɔːn/黎明/They set off at dawn.
day/deɪ/天；白天/She works eight hours a day.
dead/ded/死的/The tree has been dead for years.
deaf/def/聋的/He has been deaf since childhood.
deal/diːl/交易；处理/They made a deal with the supplier.
dear/dɪr/亲爱的/Dear friends, welcome to our school.
death/deθ/死亡/His death was a great loss to the family.
debate/dɪˈbeɪt/辩论/The students held a debate on education reform.
debt/det/债务/He is struggling to pay off his debts.
decade/ˈdekeɪd/十年/Great changes have taken place in the past decade.
decide/dɪˈsaɪd/决定/She decided to study abroad.
declare/dɪˈkler/宣布；声明/The country declared its independence.
decline/dɪˈklaɪn/下降；拒绝/The company's profits declined last year.
decorate/ˈdekəreɪt/装饰/They decorated the room for the party.
decrease/dɪˈkriːs/减少/The number of students decreased this year.
deep/diːp/深的/The lake is very deep in the middle.
defeat/dɪˈfiːt/击败；失败/Our team defeated theirs in the final match.
defend/dɪˈfend/保卫；辩护/The lawyer defended his client in court.
define/dɪˈfaɪn/定义/Can you define this term?
degree/dɪˈɡriː/程度；学位/She earned a master's degree in economics.
delay/dɪˈleɪ/延误；推迟/The flight was delayed for two hours.
deliberate/dɪˈlɪbərət/故意的；慎重的/It was a deliberate decision to resign.
delicate/ˈdelɪkət/精致的；脆弱的/This delicate vase needs careful handling.
